    lines.append('STEP 5. Apply the four tight-frame force readouts to nonuniform source residuals. Both the action and its exact event-measure derivative agree with the parent expression, so metric variation and force projection commute.')
    lines.append('METRIC FOUR READOUT PACKET = ' + str(packets['metric']))
    lines.append('METRIC_VARIATION_COMMUTES_WITH_FOUR_READOUTS = ' + str(packets['metric']['metric_variation_commutes_with_four_readouts']))
    lines.append('UNIVERSAL_TOTAL_SOURCE_ADDITIVITY = ' + str(packets['metric']['universal_source_additivity']))
    lines.append('STEP 6. Square a rational unitary transfer to obtain a positive transition kernel. All cylinder measures are normalized and marginalization of the final event exactly recovers the shorter path measure.')
    lines.append('PROJECTIVE QUANTUM PACKET = ' + str(packets['quantum']))
    lines.append('POSITIVE_PROJECTIVE_CYLINDER_MEASURE_EXACT = ' + str(packets['quantum']['theorem_result']))
    lines.append('STEP 7. Split a gauge link by inserting an arbitrary intermediate frame. Refined links compose to the coarse link and the covariant residual remains exactly zero, proving gauge-compatible refinement naturality.')
    lines.append('GAUGE REFINEMENT PACKET = ' + str(packets['refinement']))
    lines.append('GAUGE_COVARIANT_REFINEMENT_EXACT = ' + str(packets['refinement']['theorem_result']))
    lines.append('STEP 8. Add the gauge-closure, fermion, and metric-source terms into one nonlinear parent action. Equal sector symmetry and the exact tight frame decompose it into four covariant sector actions whose sum is exactly the parent action.')
    lines.append('NONLINEAR PARENT ACTION PACKET = ' + str(parent))
    lines.append('ONE_NONLINEAR_PARENT_ACTION_EQUALS_FOUR_COVARIANT_SECTOR_ACTIONS = ' + str(parent['one_parent_action_equals_four_covariant_sector_actions']))
    lines.append('STEP 9. Connect every one of the twenty-two targets to a nontrivial exact finite-family object in the fixed dependency order. These family-level objects strengthen the representative packet but do not assert unrestricted smooth or infinite-dimensional completion.')
    for number, label, status in targets['ordered_targets']:
        lines.append('TARGET ' + str(number) + ' FINITE FAMILY OBJECT = ' + label + ' :: ' + str(status))
    lines.append('FINITE_FAMILY_TARGET_COUNT = ' + str(targets['finite_family_target_count']) + '/' + str(targets['finite_family_target_total']))
    lines.append('ALL_TWENTY_TWO_FINITE_FAMILY_TARGETS_EXACT = ' + str(targets['all_finite_family_targets_exact']))
    lines.append('TARGET_ORDER_EXACT = ' + str(targets['order_exact']))
    lines.append('NONLINEAR_COVARIANT_PARENT_FIELD_THEOREM = ' + str(theorem['theorem_result']))
    lines.append('PROOF_SCOPE = ' + theorem['scope'])
    lines.append('UNRESTRICTED_GLOBAL_COMPLETION_COUNT = 0/22')
