    lines.append('STEP 6. Compare the identity mixing map with a nontrivial rational rotation. Both are unitary, determinant one, and have the same total norm, but they are distinct maps. Unitarity and coarse action ratios alone therefore do not identify one physical decoder.')
    lines.append('DECODER_ROTATION = ' + str(decoder['rotation']))
